sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as App
    participant S as Server
    U->>A: Tap "Sync"
    A->>+S: GET /changes?since=42
    S-->>-A: 3 changes
    loop for each change
        A->>A: Apply locally
    end
    alt conflict
        A->>U: Ask which version to keep
    else no conflict
        A-->>U: Done
    end
    Note over A,S: Changes are signed
